Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.38,0:22:52.55,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Tongue twisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.32,0:22:57.30,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The frogs matched three Pyocopyoco Pyocopyoco with six Pyocopyoco Pyocopyoco. {Kaeru pyokopyoko mi pyokopyoko awasete pyokopyoko mu pyokopyoko}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.95,0:22:59.27,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Good afternoon, Rin here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.98,0:23:03.35,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,A big typhoon is coming, so I went home with Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.81,0:23:08.22,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I was scared at first, but then I got excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.22,0:23:10.02,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,A typhoon is a bit mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.10,0:23:13.67,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The next story is "A Typhoon Has Come!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.74,0:23:18.99,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The neighbor's persimmon was eaten by a lot of costumers. {tonari no kaki wa yoku kyaku kuu kaki da}
