Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:14.20,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}We don't know what'll happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.20,0:01:17.62,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This feels different from a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:19.32,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Something feels different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.32,0:01:22.94,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm not thinking of it as a punishment game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.94,0:01:26.19,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I still don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.19,0:01:29.59,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though I don't quite feel satisfied with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.59,0:01:35.14,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}there's no question that you're important to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.64,0:01:41.40,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}There's nothing in this world that's endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.51,0:01:45.74,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Isn't it painful having to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.95,0:01:48.54,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Love's sweet drops, sweet drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:52.09,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.09,0:01:55.22,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to be kinder?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.61,0:01:58.98,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}As long as I'm with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.98,0:02:02.20,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you think girls can be strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:05.51,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though we can be weak sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.87,0:02:12.20,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our wish is for happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:15.64,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Those days can also be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:23.35,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy.
