Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:56.54,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:21:02.85,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe wa dokomademo
