Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.01,0:20:16.50,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}It's a sunny Sunday, early in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:20.03,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Where should we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.43,0:20:26.99,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This path I've grown so used to taking
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:31.59,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}seems to be shining brightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.72,0:20:36.94,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}as long as the warm sun is shining
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:42.02,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}and you are here beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.02,0:20:46.10,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.69,0:20:51.97,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I feel like frolicking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:56.54,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:21:02.85,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our voices can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.85,0:21:07.01,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.67,0:21:12.63,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm riding on the rising wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.32,0:21:17.49,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.01,0:21:26.55,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even our voices will be bouncing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.31,0:02:47.73,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Saionji-sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.56,0:02:51.44,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Please get a little sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:54.23,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.36,0:02:59.15,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, if I fall asleep now, I won't get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:00.61,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.82,0:03:03.66,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get a breath of fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:06.87,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,We're taking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.87,0:03:08.04,Main Dialog,Assistant A,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.04,0:03:09.08,Main Dialog,Assistant B,0000,0000,0000,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:11.71,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You guys take a break too when you get a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.21,0:03:16.13,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Call my cell if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:21.51,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,By now, we should barely make it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.39,0:03:23.26,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:55.04,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:03:59.80,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:05.51,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,It feels like ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:07.10,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You're too cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:12.85,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, if I turn off the AC, the boys mess up the manuscript with their sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.85,0:04:16.02,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,The body can cool down from stress, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:17.23,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:31.45,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,About that new offer you were talking about the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:34.92,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think letting the quality of your current work drop
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:37.29,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,is worth taking it on...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:43.92,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,But Ma-chan, you don't really have a strong constitution or will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:46.72,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,And you're making a decent living as it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:48.39,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,so there's no need to be greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:49.10,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:50.64,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:53.10,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, the spotlight's on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.10,0:04:55.48,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,but who knows what'll happen next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:05:00.32,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Any number of younger rookie artists will gradually appear...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.19,0:05:06.28,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,They could turn their backs on me, just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:10.78,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Ma-chan, you worry too much about what could go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:12.41,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,It's unhealthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:16.71,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You have an ink mark on your face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:17.83,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.59,0:05:21.63,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Tch...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:25.42,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Ma-chan, you're a girl, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:30.22,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:32.06,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a mangaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:36.10,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going home to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.90,0:05:42.69,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for making a scene...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:46.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:50.70,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Going to work is a pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:05:57.12,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:05:59.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:01.09,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I called you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:04.34,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. It was just so hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:07.34,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you cooling off by doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:08.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.35,0:06:13.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Want to make your lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:14.22,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:29.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:30.86,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Give me a hand here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.53,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:37.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's summer vacation has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:40.12,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,In the morning, we make her lunch together,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.12,0:06:42.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and then Rin goes to a day care center.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:48.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How about we visit Grandpa's grave next Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:49.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's almost O-Bon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:54.22,Main Dialog,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Note: O-Bon = Holiday in which people honor their ancestors
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:50.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and since it's your...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.30,0:06:53.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What? You don't want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:06:58.39,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,After all, the bellflowers haven't bloomed yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.94,0:07:03.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like it'll take a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:06.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, this time, we'll buy flowers at a florist,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:09.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and we can go again when your flowers bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.61,0:07:10.57,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:18.91,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You'd make Grandpa happy by bringing him the bellflowers that you grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:21.50,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,See? That's what I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:27.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But what would make Grandpa happiest is for you to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:28.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:31.59,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:33.18,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.56,0:07:46.65,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If Rin weren't here, I probably wouldn't be thinking of Grandpa like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:50.82,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.36,0:07:52.61,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:56.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you move, it screws the whole thing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:57.87,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.45,0:08:01.91,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why is your hair so fine to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.91,0:08:02.75,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:14.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:17.14,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.51,0:08:19.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! We're going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:23.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:27.36,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, how many more days?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:34.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,About ten, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.61,0:08:36.24,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:39.49,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,A cicada shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.49,0:08:40.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A shell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:45.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh. This brings back memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:48.92,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I've got a bunch of 'em in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:52.34,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:54.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't shake them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:57.97,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:01.81,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.81,0:09:04.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Watch out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:10.44,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I've been here a lot of times before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:12.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,With Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:13.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.07,0:09:17.53,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Grandma's laid to rest here too, come to think of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.53,0:09:19.41,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa's grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.41,0:09:21.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, my grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:26.71,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Grandpa and Grandma's child is my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:29.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And I'm her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:32.46,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother is Grandpa's daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.71,0:09:34.51,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:38.64,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Then that makes me your mother's sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:42.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Crap! I don't want her to go in this direction...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:44.98,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.06,0:09:48.65,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:54.32,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The grave's wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.45,0:10:05.66,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That jar...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:09.17,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san had it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:12.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Ma...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:21.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck? She didn't even come to his funeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:25.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.43,0:10:27.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Stay here for a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:32.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Pull up the weeds for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:34.44,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:57.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:11:00.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, she goes with a man to visit the grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:12.94,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Bark! Bark!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.24,0:11:26.54,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,What?! What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:29.00,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you were some crazy person...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:31.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm supposed to be visiting a grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.87,0:11:33.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Accent on the "supposed to be."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:36.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But I thought maybe I should let you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:40.34,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.97,0:11:43.34,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,At Grandpa's grave...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:48.64,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:58.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Rin's dear to me, so to be honest, I don't often think about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:01.70,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care about your circumstances either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:06.53,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Unless Rin wishes for it, I have no intention of ever having you two meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:08.91,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.12,0:12:14.04,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But you went out of your way to follow me. What did you want to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:19.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to at least get a look at Rin secretly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:25.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Now, we're going to clean the grave off, light incense, and go home like normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:27.64,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I think it'll take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.47,0:12:31.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, Rin is waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.94,0:12:38.65,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.65,0:12:40.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We're just going to go about our business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.70,0:12:54.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin... Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:12:56.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Was I gone long?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:07.43,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.47,0:13:10.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:13.27,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I had to do something...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:15.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.69,0:13:16.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you wait long?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.73,0:13:17.90,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Not too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:20.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Were you lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:23.74,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:25.99,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you so nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:28.87,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.49,0:13:31.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.45,0:13:32.24,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:34.54,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:35.71,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.17,0:13:48.72,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,She's no longer a baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:53.60,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Blood ties are an amazing thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:56.52,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Yep. She looks just like you, Ma-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:13:59.10,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,From behind...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:01.15,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,She's pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.11,0:14:04.78,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,From this distance...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:07.95,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,he closely resembles Souichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:17.87,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:22.67,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,That was a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:26.42,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe a coincidence like this happened because it's nearly O-Bon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:30.05,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,She's seven years old today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.05,0:14:31.80,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.80,0:14:34.35,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,I was surprised about your daughter, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.35,0:14:36.77,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,but I thought maybe he was your ex-boyfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.77,0:14:37.93,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.56,0:14:42.31,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think that man's got a bit of intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.03,0:14:54.20,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Although I can't say what he'd be like given another half a century...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:56.89,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Half... a century?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:03.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose that man was her boyfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:07.13,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.13,0:15:09.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And it's a stretch for me to say it's bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.51,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.51,0:15:13.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But some people...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.22,0:15:16.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, she sure found herself a sweetheart fast enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.35,0:15:18.23,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:19.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:21.90,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can we go to Grandpa's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:24.44,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's near here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.77,0:15:29.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But that's not Grandpa's house anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.07,0:15:31.78,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is somebody living there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.78,0:15:37.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No. No one's living there now, but the house is my uncle's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:40.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,My mom's older brother's house, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.66,0:15:42.75,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The family altar is there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.71,0:15:45.96,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.09,0:15:54.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Fine. I'll ask my uncle if we can just go in the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.89,0:15:55.91,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:57.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Only the yard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:15:58.43,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.89,0:16:00.85,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:11.86,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to try and do that assignment after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.28,0:16:13.61,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.99,0:16:16.12,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure about this, Ma-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:19.66,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm alone for the sake of my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:21.75,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I have to do more work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:23.83,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You're already working plenty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.83,0:16:25.83,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You work enough for two people!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:28.25,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's not enough yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.17,0:16:32.59,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I have to work so hard that I forget what I had for dinner last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.59,0:16:36.85,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, come on. I always forget what I had for dinner the previous night...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.85,0:16:37.97,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:40.89,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't forget many things...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:42.56,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.98,0:16:52.03,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:12.30,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same as before, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:17.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But you've totally changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:37.36,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.36,0:17:38.62,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The bellflowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:40.66,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The dirt is gone too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:45.12,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The bellflowers were precious to Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:50.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he didn't mean to remove them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.17,0:17:55.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Uncle knows Grandpa's favorite flower, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:17:59.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But they wither up when winter comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.59,0:18:03.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe he didn't know that they sprout when spring comes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.14,0:18:07.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The rocks, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:10.65,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't spread them all over like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.65,0:18:13.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,weeds will soon spring up and become tough to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:21.41,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad we moved Rin's fragrant olive tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.41,0:18:22.53,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That saved its life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:32.00,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But thankfully we have Grandpa's bellflowers at our house too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:36.34,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Because of that, they're still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.93,0:18:39.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:47.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe change isn't all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:52.81,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But that grave will always be Grandpa's grave, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.81,0:18:53.48,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:03.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:10.12,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:13.21,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a chocolate one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:20.72,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Saionji-sensei, can you do the final check?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.93,0:19:23.51,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.18,0:19:27.06,Main Dialog,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You really do seem to be in over your head this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:31.90,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,When you put it into words like that, my hand stops working, so cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.03,0:19:45.16,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.83,0:19:53.63,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll finish it, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:47.28,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, the festival stalls are going to close!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.28,0:21:49.12,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, they won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.95,0:21:53.24,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It sounds like Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.04,0:21:58.67,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:04.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.09,0:22:05.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We're supposed to meet up at the shrine, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.88,0:22:07.84,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Mom is taking too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.84,0:22:09.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're not wearing a yukata?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.89,0:22:12.01,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I can't jump with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.10,0:22:14.81,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Was that awesome or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.18,0:22:17.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Where's your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:20.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She said she'll leave once she puts on her yukata, so we should meet at the shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:29.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.07,0:22:30.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Before the festival stalls close!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.87,0:22:38.87,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, watch out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.87,0:22:40.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.00,0:22:42.71,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! It's hard to run in geta!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.71,0:22:43.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll carry you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:44.42,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.42,0:22:45.84,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,You can carry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.84,0:22:47.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it!
